            "title": "What Do Soaring Returns Mean for Mitsui E&S After Record Earnings Growth in 2025?",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "If you hold MITSUI E&S or are considering jumping in, you\u2019re not alone in wondering if the stock still has room to run. After all, not many names in the market boast a jaw-dropping 143.2% return year-to-date and an eye-popping 277.4% gain over the past year. Zoom out a bit further, and the numbers are even more staggering, with the stock surging nearly 950% in just three years. Even with a minor 0.5% slip over the last week, the 8.0% pop in the past month signals that the growth narrative is...",
